#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:26 4d64eb47bf0b4287a72675037975d98b
msgid ""
"depending on frame type, roll and pitch axis control may not be implemented,"
" so tuning is obviously unnecessary. Yaw control is always implemented in "
"Sub frames."
msgstr "根据机架类型，横滚和俯仰轴控制可能未实现，因此调参显然是不必要的。偏航控制在所有 Sub 机架中始终可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:28 a30ef2f8e37a42a2b5ea0220199d1cb7
msgid "For each axis:"
msgstr "对于每个轴："

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:30 a28ad8725c244a57b9bd6a9e57a1a83a
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"If the vehicle already oscillates in an axis, first lower the P, D, and I "
"terms in 50% steps until stable, before starting manual tuning."
msgstr "如果飞行器在某轴上已出现振荡，请先以 50% 的步长降低 P、D、I 项，直到稳定后再开始手动调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:32 8b014cdd3d8548b194dce60a7304d060
msgid ""
"When oscillations start do not make large or sudden stick inputs, and reduce"
" the parameter increased as soon as possible."
msgstr "当振荡开始时，不要进行大幅或突然的摇杆输入，并尽快降低已增大的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:34 6e61095e7abb4fa6bdced4388e2ce581
#, no-python-format
msgid "Increase the D term in steps of 50% until oscillation is observed"
msgstr "以 50% 的步长增加 D 项，直到观察到振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:35 037b4e2520e24c69aca8a4bdd64915cc
#, no-python-format
msgid "Reduce the D term in steps of 10% until the oscillation disappears"
msgstr "以 10% 步进逐步降低 D 项直至振荡消失"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:36 a3fdcc9a2bf5460d876857205727d3e1
msgid "Reduce the D term by a further 25%"
msgstr "再进一步将 D 项减小 25%"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:37 833cd81549444f94bd0b9af9b9a56154
#, no-python-format
msgid "Increase the P term in steps of 50% until oscillation is observed"
msgstr "以 50% 的步长增加 P 项，直到观察到振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:38 c234d644b13a4f6f836e227339a5cd9b
#, no-python-format
msgid "Reduce the P term in steps of 10% until the oscillation disappears"
msgstr "以 10% 步进逐步降低 P 项直至振荡消失"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:39 21234bf062004d98b05d3513a8cb6f04
msgid "Reduce the P term by a further 25%"
msgstr "再进一步将 P 项减小 25%"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:41 2beebcd86e9143209aa371191ffba3fd
msgid ""
"Each time the P term is changed set the I term to approximately 3/4 the P "
"term. Those parameters can be changed on the surface, and preferably when "
"disarmed."
msgstr "每次更改 P 项时，将 I 项设置为 P 项的约 3/4。这些参数可以在水面上更改，最好在解除解锁状态时进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/manual-tuning.rst:43 fc12a16fce044d8ca48421dc4017617d
msgid "The other ``ATC_`` rarely need changing from the defaults."
msgstr "其他 ``ATC_`` 参数很少需要更改默认值。"

